# Pull request descriptions

When creating or editing GitHub pull request descriptions:

- Do **not** include `Made with Cursor`, `Made with [Cursor](...)`, or any equivalent Cursor attribution / footer.
- Do **not** add marketing footers, AI-generated-by lines, or similar trailing attribution.
- Keep the body focused on Summary, Test plan, and any stack/dependency notes the user requested.
